        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: रहस्य",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रहस्य — rahasya — \"a mystery; a secret\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चोरी का रहस्य पाँच साल तक नहीं खुला। corī kā rahasya pā̃c sāl tak nahīṃ khulā. The mystery of the theft stayed unsolved for five years."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Masculine."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "रहस्य (rahasya) is Sanskrit rahasya, \"secret, private\" (Monier-Williams), from rahas, solitude. A mystery खुलता है, opens, when it is solved."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
