            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सच सुनकर सब लोग चौंक गए। sac sunkar sab log cauṅk gae. Everyone was startled to hear the truth."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (she …): वह चौंक गई, vah cauṅk gaī."
            }
