          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "चौंकना (cauṅknā) is listed by CDIAL beside चमकना, to flash, under camakka, a sudden movement (CDIAL 4676): a start of surprise is a sudden jerk of the body. Hindi writes it with the anusvara."
            }
          ]
